      "prompt": "Turn this discovery summary into a concise mind map. A regional healthcare network plans a patient appointment platform for clinics, call-center staff, and patients. The product must support search, booking, rescheduling, cancellation, waitlists, reminders, and accessibility. Legacy provider calendars update at different intervals, so the design needs conflict detection, idempotent requests, audit history, and graceful recovery from delayed integrations. The rollout has pilot, regional, and network-wide stages with measurable adoption, booking success, latency, support volume, rollback criteria, and privacy review. Organize goals, actors, workflows, integrations, rollout, metrics, risks, security, and acceptance criteria without repeating paragraphs.",
